# Optional controls: customers can enable these via module variables. Defaults
# leave encryption as Google-managed and access logging off so we do not force
# a log bucket or CMEK on every consumer. Prefer the inline `#trivy:ignore`
# comments on google_storage_bucket.import; these IDs keep the table/SARIF
# scanners quiet when they do not honor resource comments.
#
# AVD-GCP-0001 / AVD-GCP-0088 are stale names for these checks (now GCP-0066
# and GCP-0077).
AVD-GCP-0066
AVD-GCP-0077
